    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always had a fondness for maths, even without formal education. It’s something I’ve picked up through daily life—like budgeting or measuring ingredients while cooking. I enjoy solving problems, especially in history and real-world situations. It’s not about complex formulas, but about logic and patterns I see around me.",
